You've got some yij, and then you've got an intercept, and then you've got your beta values times your numerical variable,

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.000
and you've got some error here.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:31.000
And so, this is one intercept and one slope for all observations, and factor A is not even in this model.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.000
And so, in R, we put this in as y tilde x.

