Now, we want to add some parallel regression lines, and we're going to allow the factor to change the intercept.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.000
But, we require the slope to remain constant.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:49.000
We've got the same response, and we've got an intercept.

